  "description": "Fertilizer nutrient management for .NET, with zero dependencies. Works out how much of each fertilizer to use to hit a target PPM profile by solving the mix as a linear program, and calculates the PPM of a given mixture. Ships a curated catalogue of 34 fertilizers and 22 blending scenarios, a target-string parser, and a fully managed simplex solver with no native dependencies — so the whole pipeline also runs under WebAssembly.",
